#: scenario4:scenario4_DC2A8067_BE03_4F93_BCA8_AA4BB14E7DB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d08b5029d0e0db3695abfef2616781c280a081bd6a9619c7949e40919c8f3136
