msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There once was a witch, skilled in the dark arts. ⟪k:3⟫She lived a meager, but "
"peaceful life alongside the other villagers."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫C’era una volta una strega, esperta nelle arti oscure.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Trascorreva una "
"vita misera ma pacifica insieme agli altri abitanti del villaggio."

#: scenario4:scenario4_15ED5119_5FCA_49D1_BCE5_D6457583B0F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7901e6bf749ce61a418ec3476e39fc12b607626ac9fb04e545eb6b86f5dc8113
#. default-sha256: e553a30adc1b99d972a8d9699456a901417f49a042e3f90134cacdfc6046c6d8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_15ED5119_5FCA_49D1_BCE5_D6457583B0F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But then, a long, long drought struck the village, which the people blamed on the witch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma quest’ultimo venne colpito da un lungo periodo di siccità,⟪k:1⟫di cui la strega venne "
"incolpata."

#: scenario4:scenario4_822F34E0_7F5A_4C54_85DC_AFC9FE8F3246
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33f4480b694f03b72e75107c54a0331d900644ee7f57e2a299633696e3a534c0
#. default-sha256: 3adbd630fcc023c9fdd6058fedf0346c29d0232a5f5edd3f0eda27616ae610df
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_822F34E0_7F5A_4C54_85DC_AFC9FE8F3246"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The witch was sentenced to death, and as the fire blazed around her, smoke rose high into "
"the air. ⟪k:1⟫The smoke soon became rainclouds, blessing the village with an end to the drought."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La strega fu condannata a morte, e mentre il fuoco bruciava attorno a lei, del fumo rosa si "
"levò in alto nel cielo. ⟪k:1⟫Ben presto, il fumo formò delle nuvole portatrici di pioggia, che "
"benedirono il villaggio con la fine della siccità."

#: scenario4:scenario4_75ECEF99_AB6A_493F_AFDD_4BF1231C32D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9bbed0eddef6d3f27526f8fcaa8c93a7e9df9c491975f453c7b9c257b6c74c0
#. default-sha256: 974cc6b6148c91b23759ecafb851bc1310039f91df3ce9bc85e24447106f39f4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_75ECEF99_AB6A_493F_AFDD_4BF1231C32D5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The crops were revitalized, and the villagers fancied themselves heroes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫I raccolti tornarono rigogliosi, e i paesani si autoproclamarono eroi."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1FEBF35B_74A9_426A_9ED0_662304A26013
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b1425febeeb13b26bc702cbc45b4f804077298712f6f6fb16849b29f044409c
