msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1FEBF35B_74A9_426A_9ED0_662304A26013"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the rain also brought madness upon the people.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Though the earth below them "
"was lush and fertile,⟪k:3⟫the villagers were losing their minds,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, la pioggia portò anche pazzia tra la gente.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sebbene la loro terra fosse "
"fertile e lussureggiante,⟪k:3⟫gli abitanti stavano perdendo la testa,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C231E26C_8323_44D6_A318_3DB948571F9E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: adc591b23d303e136db1ba5b95fd33eb0dd93332887a2e661f7511d64e1585dd
