msgid "⟪k:0⟫The witch still lived on—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫in the form of a curse."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La strega continuò a vivere—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫sottoforma di maledizione."

#: scenario4:scenario4_680BBEDF_F173_4408_A332_5B7F1413A312
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9057cbd6b05c4eea97c623e8fd6b3826d6aafe1530c22c6d9c342e1f589afb01
