msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_680BBEDF_F173_4408_A332_5B7F1413A312"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Many fell victim to the witch’s curse. ⟪k:1⟫Though it did not only take—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫it also "
"fulfilled people’s desires."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Molte furono le sue vittime. ⟪k:1⟫Eppure non aveva solo ucciso—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫aveva anche "
"esaudito i desideri della gente."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6E93AF0E_3F0B_43E5_8203_FF7AFE8D2AB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fdab111167f83a30df792fcb5d58884e0704902ebf430c1b433c91269fa6f537
