msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_71CF4F07_DA57_42DD_A8DA_1E4989D87721"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The two of them left the library and made their way to the room with the stained-glass "
"window. ⟪k:1⟫At the far end of that room were the stairs to the observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I due lasciarono la biblioteca e si diressero verso la stanza con la vetrata. ⟪k:1⟫In fondo "
"ad essa c’erano le scale che conducevano alla torre d’osservazione."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9264DB10_FCB0_4EAF_A93C_A9CD85A78D3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eea0c18c7b777dac77617b0d0d974e629946c74c65436843927a5b591c2df542
#. default-sha256: d562068e8ca81360d00b1aaf1f065f6dc336ceec4363dbe4dc70d60316bf9dc6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9264DB10_FCB0_4EAF_A93C_A9CD85A78D3E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The tale of the witch had piqued the White-Haired Girl’s interest, inspiring her to put "
"herself forward to satisfy that curiosity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La storia della strega aveva suscitato l’interesse della Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi, "
"motivandola a soddisfare la propria curiosità."

#: scenario4:scenario4_57214629_ED20_4FA1_88F5_3167DDEF3496
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22cc7e1bb99ace10a332b9995b03cf8b2ecc684b07baeb2c56205943cae18a6f
#. default-sha256: be9db7f5da14dd35457aac795f4b073585672c9aa82fbd9e5e818ec2c9825477
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_57214629_ED20_4FA1_88F5_3167DDEF3496"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had, after all, been accused of being a witch herself, so she undoubtedly felt an "
"affinity to the legend."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫In fin dei conti, era stata accusata lei stessa di essere una strega,⟪k:1⟫pertanto era "
"indubbio che avvertisse una certa affinità con la leggenda."

#: scenario4:scenario4_4ADAC2C0_C8CF_4270_BF39_562E6746F0AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21d3e10af0de5dfb508ae92c483dcd9425cb3bf007287428b2d48b8653710961
#. default-sha256: 889d988aef8877d3d33af095d3d1cbb0065a920487db259ff9545362fdd9249d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_4ADAC2C0_C8CF_4270_BF39_562E6746F0AF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What a sweet girl she was.⟪k:1⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Che ragazza dolce che era.⟪k:1⟫"

#: scenario4:scenario4_49AB0168_0BFF_4FA2_8EE8_7FD96A89692B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a80472f8c5e081036fe9c6652eec3b833d9a94295308cbe44705c3f20b3d3df
#. default-sha256: 77ef509004a72acc19b5eb5b3370dff095a77b70078dafbc0832037bdc21eacc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_49AB0168_0BFF_4FA2_8EE8_7FD96A89692B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With Michel in the lead, the two climbed a long, long spiral staircase. ⟪k:1⟫There were many "
"more stairs than the White-Haired Girl had anticipated, and she soon found herself short of "
"breath."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Con Michel a fare da guida, i due salirono una lunga scala a chiocciola. ⟪k:1⟫C’erano molti "
"più gradini di quanto la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi⟪k:2⟫si era aspettata, e presto si ritrovò a "
"corto di fiato."

#: scenario4:scenario4_BFE8A313_D7D2_46CD_9BF9_FB338F656C81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 012da497ef98e2183900320ece8a390c7d564100e35656ee073191182e63857f
#. default-sha256: a8c05edb61230f5250345794a5af3bb2d1bc3266a5f5049d05033ac05d3439f4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BFE8A313_D7D2_46CD_9BF9_FB338F656C81"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Rectangular windows were carved out of the stone in regular intervals.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Peering "
"through one of them, she could see a village in the distance.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A pleasantly cool, high-"
"altitude breeze brushed across her face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Finestre rettangolari erano state ricavate dalla pietra a intervalli regolari.⟪k:1⟫ "
"Affacciandosi da una di esse, la ragazza poté scorgere un villaggio in lontananza.⟪k:2⟫ Una "
"fresca e piacevole brezza le accarezzò⟪k:3⟫il viso."

#: scenario4:scenario4_270F6A86_8C3F_43D8_84F0_27CEBECB8C40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad952cd0af416d21eb13aed6525af3e77a939d576181d3a99780dbc48edcf58c
#. default-sha256: c5cd9b9c045ba2dc1035ec760379e74b9aaaf1dcc1e2280687272dad98bd58ab
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_270F6A86_8C3F_43D8_84F0_27CEBECB8C40"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫After much climbing, they finally arrived at the top, where a door made of "
"partially rotted wood stood. ⟪k:3⟫Michel pulled open the door,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dopo aver camminato a lungo, arrivarono in cima, dove c’era una porta in legno "
"parzialmente marcita. ⟪k:3⟫Michel aprì la porta,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_49F2455F_56FD_480D_9FBD_536B2CAB6D6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50849e09b7d44fd8a1946171fea6d36e33085d7cfd00799f243ba189bd418223
#. default-sha256: ad27f1ee250b4dc13f20ea88ef3d25cafd6166973f7682f9e7ccce978ad70d6a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_49F2455F_56FD_480D_9FBD_536B2CAB6D6E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫revealing a small room with no windows or doors in sight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫rivelando una piccola stanza senza finestre né porte."

#: scenario4:scenario4_2450C494_16D3_472C_ABAC_4FB3A8B26FAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3693fcd54c2aa15babff91ced7cb598aaa62739d4bcfce169df1b4dccfe33921
#. default-sha256: 51cc607aa335dfe65beb8c39c4d49145d02295d97784405f940991a96c0c96b3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2450C494_16D3_472C_ABAC_4FB3A8B26FAA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This is... ⟪k:3⟫the top of the tower?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫È⟪k:4⟫ questa... ⟪k:5⟫la cima della torre?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_469ACD43_F360_4D40_9337_C7C39BAAA1C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 009b81046c8f2afe85ed17beadbd2f4f29faaccf6ca22d75a4d8a70e28d4b982
#. default-sha256: 3c4d5aa9e7c37ea177f2b4dc446079084b704f7f7906dd7f7ca682186963bf65
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_469ACD43_F360_4D40_9337_C7C39BAAA1C0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite it being called an “observation” tower,⟪k:1⟫you could hardly observe anything from "
"there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonostante venisse chiamata torre “d’osservazione”,⟪k:1⟫non si riusciva a vedere nulla da lì."

#: scenario4:scenario4_91F67F05_9FD7_4CCA_BE9A_2FB93429678E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa788735329b78b4ea4ce30a68e697e22dfd0f7954e68a9e9ba5c763c00e355a
#. default-sha256: af2430f5cfe19f59953eb1da159756423d779f6308c7aed2ee5020f1af3728ab
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_91F67F05_9FD7_4CCA_BE9A_2FB93429678E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her face contorted in confusion, the White-Haired Girl threw her gaze about the room. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Glancing up, she saw only a darkened ceiling—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Con un’espressione confusa, la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi osservò la stanza.⟪k:1⟫ "
"Sollevando lo sguardo, vide solamente un soffitto oscurato—"

#: scenario4:scenario4_EE08DDC7_DBCC_4473_8EE1_206FC8B7867A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb59e2524996cc155d3224e1073bf420ab30e6b835fefa15fabc16b5a3e545e7
#. default-sha256: 59915035ea6eeb4a4f03d4634698f24dfbd2fb1c5ceccb086bd36466149abb41
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EE08DDC7_DBCC_4473_8EE1_206FC8B7867A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and, slightly below it, a single small window through which shone a little ray of light."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫e poco sotto, una singola, piccola finestra attraverso cui risplendeva un piccolo raggio di "
"sole."

#: scenario4:scenario4_EC304EF2_BDBB_4265_B4C3_F2B09A7FAB33
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: beeaa42df67cc0a4bc4788ce6ff512bd5c5788b8bc8d251bc00d3a06c4466b0c
#. default-sha256: 1a5b1b1ec02f21e52be3253defb1c410940ee473d802aa66ca3bbf56fafd0131
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EC304EF2_BDBB_4265_B4C3_F2B09A7FAB33"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The beam cleaved through the darkness like the sharpened blade of a beautiful sword."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il fascio luminoso spaccava l’oscurità come la lama affilata di una spada."

#: scenario4:scenario4_87F10E3A_D125_40FE_B5DE_6D19AF1ACCB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3bdb89f937cde0bcd0bf3949083bcc02ff0ca5d9c0c9a0057f4a2fa5386aa13f
#. default-sha256: a3a0c40e5bcf53cbb69607b4cab9331fae75a8dd9bfcb623d41b85afe4d43278
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_87F10E3A_D125_40FE_B5DE_6D19AF1ACCB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The darkness draped over the rest of the room only served to make more impressive that "
"solitary ray of light."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le tenebre che avvolgevano il resto della stanza servivano soltanto a rendere ancora più "
"maestoso quel solitario raggio di luce."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D72BA3A5_89B0_4D14_AC35_7B775885F7FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad1d4fe3b277d0b1483cdcdb7602716fb8f6f73210bd929960339b6581f31433
#. default-sha256: d8d1d7898c3b7073342334d54c5dc6d5b8bf0a754de5bb4d47547ee35d9fcbc6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D72BA3A5_89B0_4D14_AC35_7B775885F7FC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It had a magical, fairy-tale quality to it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Aveva un che di magico e fiabesco."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1E541513_5969_453E_8B6E_BABD41A78AAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1cff52da00b1ce0c22493103faeb16d17ff4263a5bb2dcc12b052a8c9d8ffc6
#. default-sha256: 976a50db9dc3bb4f9a4147345e1bffa750500e17b5a4e7bc83258db995cc6578
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1E541513_5969_453E_8B6E_BABD41A78AAF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As if being pulled in by it, she drew toward the light."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Come se ne fosse stata attratta, la ragazza si avvicinò alla luce."

#: scenario4:scenario4_54096ADB_53CA_44CA_990D_3DC843B79FC4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7bcf2cbf2a1be0a134a15cdbb612743c8f3334fd7b8c1c27531b5fb5b7659375
#. default-sha256: 001f923343fb13777fa6955d6af466e8d87e0d7f172a2ab1896bbf2a47ec87eb
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54096ADB_53CA_44CA_990D_3DC843B79FC4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I suspect there was once a large window in this room.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If you look closely, you can "
"see seams in the stone of the wall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Credo ci fosse una finestra più larga in questa stanza.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se guardi attentamente, "
"puoi notare il contorno sul muro."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B7DE50E3_2E21_43BD_9075_6A1080080B63
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 366f930a40d0a4fac4dd5a969b55ebdf1d9a3906138f555fdf7660fc9c40462f
#. default-sha256: dbd61f4d2f6479d777dad81f235ae6d4cffad24187e70a4b807fc23b50767944
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B7DE50E3_2E21_43BD_9075_6A1080080B63"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The color of the stone differs slightly on either side of the seams.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I presume "
"something caused them to seal off the window⟪k:3⟫after it was built."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il colore della pietra è leggermente diverso oltre questa sagoma.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Suppongo che "
"qualcosa li avesse costretti a sigillare la finestra dopo che la villa è stata costruita."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A1A2EF23_130D_4C4C_BC72_7BB2EB6D00E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc8c09c66a2eff819876492c197c158ed1d8bfed1ff3aee3a5af2d4421436642
#. default-sha256: f3a6010636030cab744ab1af154f940b865807a79a7ccf1b998ea23802e014b8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A1A2EF23_130D_4C4C_BC72_7BB2EB6D00E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though I don’t know what that something... ⟪k:1⟫might... ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫be..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Anche se ⟪k:1⟫non... ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫so... ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫cosa..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7F25F21C_F8FC_41CB_B6C9_005B238CE407
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c66e2bfd5971f1462b060d93a4ab437f297b70fe09c22d032a5b6f262f0736ee
#. default-sha256: a14fe0c39337da345127d2bacf996a903ba104ad38815433205c0c8d8718d5af
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7F25F21C_F8FC_41CB_B6C9_005B238CE407"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫When Michel’s eyes fell upon the White-Haired Girl "
"wrapped in that beam of light, he sputtered to a stop."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Quando gli occhi di Michel si posarono sul volto "
"illuminato della Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi, balbettò fino a smettere di parlare."

#: scenario4:scenario4_61BB9077_43C2_47AA_A83A_8106A68E8A21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05527a72d056f66bd6c796644e05d773d3185215a12b6d804b3432e501f3dfd7
#. default-sha256: dcac650c7ea11b4ae3280a20c05df459269773fa11dcd73ad1bd16c94f75277f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_61BB9077_43C2_47AA_A83A_8106A68E8A21"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man who never flinched at anything—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫who had long since distanced himself from "
"such stirrings of the heart—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was utterly bewitched."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’uomo che non batteva ciglio di fronte a nulla—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫che era rimasto⟪k:3⟫a lungo "
"distante dal fermento del cuore—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫rimase stregato."

#: scenario4:scenario4_CDBA04FC_C536_4BA2_97AA_F8750736FF45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cff893601de501994f0cbe3a9a9553d415533d780c4074af877ffe4875f854a4
#. default-sha256: e0ce1821830b5a0a66d24060b9b9441bf91d04dd6cdaf1af5333ada9f0385de9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CDBA04FC_C536_4BA2_97AA_F8750736FF45"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had never seen her illuminated so vividly before, and he was having a great deal of "
"trouble finding the words to describe her striking beauty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non l’aveva mai vista così vividamente illuminata, e aveva grosse difficoltà a trovare le "
"parole per descrivere la sua straordinaria bellezza."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E2960547_51B6_4B7A_AB8B_50CDB511CE7A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df9d84e0be875ea0235599a42083505abee71da049de1819d88cf585c6ef1000
#. default-sha256: 0c011a3f1b6eba46b02634e072a75ec5017cea74cac23aa16a480d9e1ec7d9e6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E2960547_51B6_4B7A_AB8B_50CDB511CE7A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For someone who had been chased out of her home and accused of being a witch, the White-"
"Haired Girl looked less like a practitioner of the dark arts,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Per essere una che era stata cacciata di casa e accusata di essere una strega, la Ragazza "
"dai Capelli Bianchi non sembrava affatto una praticante delle arti oscure,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_EE28FDA0_6292_4AA1_B783_8C17C869EBEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe6bbbbbd4e3c307059afdf6312967f389f9dea978c53b3ae1fc5aa0c1307f49
#. default-sha256: 43f301e38fcc9082c0c2be02e440dbab91ee259ce9fd0ecc3bbf569050f7fd07
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EE28FDA0_6292_4AA1_B783_8C17C869EBEB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and more like one of the host of Heaven."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫quanto piuttosto un angelo disceso dal Paradiso."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3729F7BD_4F3E_41B6_8D94_CAA145ECE30B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7cd6c8ffc75b34d6a59f3df632804d7d80e75e2a4c7285f87214430e16b07a0a
#. default-sha256: b10d82a68a4d62c3150b0936b91ec0a6453ec8e4e51fd231ecb20cc3c4dfeb9e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3729F7BD_4F3E_41B6_8D94_CAA145ECE30B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"

#: scenario4:scenario4_CF9D9494_DEED_4AA2_B5D7_D2144049DC87
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52be5df274e5a205bb89d3b9d090dfed874c3689c1d959b362ea78618265ea19
#. default-sha256: 6ad01e3b08521f3e926203c3afe4d2fa75390284d604738eaf185fdb0b45ca4f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CF9D9494_DEED_4AA2_B5D7_D2144049DC87"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Michel undoubtedly felt the same way, for his gaze was affixed firmly upon her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel era indubbiamente dello stesso pensiero, poiché il suo sguardo era fisso su di lei."

#: scenario4:scenario4_430576B2_59B9_4025_9B4B_0B7EFE375D50
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 447e93b03ab1ef3d460c93f44e9a9469dea15a457aa826dbe8c22eb351bc2376
#. default-sha256: e3be6ba79f3b7b376ce7a27663a0c92c61f580388345df9b6d3e66d7b57c3aaa
