msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫for if they did, it would mean the White-Haired Girl’s death. ⟪k:1⟫No matter how much they "
"yearned for it, they could not touch one another, so they did so within the confines of their "
"imagination,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫poiché se l’avessero fatto, sarebbe stata la fine per la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi.⟪k:1⟫ "
"Non aveva importanza quanto lo bramassero, non potevano toccarsi, e così lo facevano nei limiti "
"della propria fantasia,"

