"the mansion as a whole,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫I due emanavano serenità."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C7B6C7A5_394A_4522_98E1_40E8CD657379
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
