msgid "⟪k:0⟫at the top of the observation tower, a pure bond was being shared."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Per quanto quella villa potesse essere considerata “maledetta”,⟪k:1⟫in cima alla torre "
"d’osservazione era stato condiviso un legame incorrotto."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E5F3F0B0_6174_4AF7_8739_938F0A4EDE91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
