msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They simply wanted to be together, that was all.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Their wish was hardly unreasonable—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Volevano semplicemente stare insieme, tutto qui.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ciò che desideravano era "
"tutt’altro che irragionevole—"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FA73F7B6_65BC_4AE4_BD13_AAFD13C7B8C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
